2. General Web Text Excerpts — FineWeb-Edu Attribution (ODC-By 1.0)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
Short context windows from general educational web text included in unit files (`u/`)
for contrast (`general_text`) are excerpted from the FineWeb-Edu dataset:

  Contains information from FineWeb-Edu (HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu), which is made
  available by the FineWeb authors under the Open Data Commons Attribution License v1.0
  (ODC-By 1.0): https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/

Citation:
  Penedo G, Kydlíček H, Ben Allal L, Lozhkov A, Mitchell M, Raffel C, Von Werra L,
  Wolf T. The FineWeb datasets: decanting the web for the finest text data at scale.
  Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems 37 (NeurIPS 2024 Datasets and
  Benchmarks Track); 2024. p. 30811-30849. https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu

Underlying web crawls originate from Common Crawl and remain subject to Common Crawl's
Terms of Use (https://commoncrawl.org/terms-of-use) and any applicable rights in the
individual source web pages.


3. Prescription Drug Label Excerpts — openFDA Public Domain Notice
------------------------------------------------------------------
Prescription drug label excerpts and established pharmacologic class mappings are derived
from United States Food and Drug Administration (FDA) Structured Product Labeling via
openFDA (https://open.fda.gov/apis/drug/label/; https://open.fda.gov/license/):

  openFDA data are United States Government public-domain / CC0 1.0 Universal records.
  Use of openFDA data in this repository does not imply endorsement by the U.S. Food and
  Drug Administration or the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services. Do not rely on
  openFDA or this dataset to make decisions regarding medical care.

Citation:
  Kass-Hout TA, Xu Z, Mohebbi M, Nelsen H, Baker A, Levine J, et al. OpenFDA: an
  innovative platform providing access to a wealth of FDA's publicly available data.
  J Am Med Inform Assoc. 2016;23(3):596-600. doi:10.1093/jamia/ocv153


4. Model Notice
---------------
Neuron activations and logit-lens vocabulary projections were computed on Qwen/Qwen3-8B,
released by the Qwen Team under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0; Yang et al., arXiv:2505.09388).


